  "title": "Nordic American Tankers Ltd (NYSE: NAT) – Alexander Hansson purchase more shares in NAT",
  "summary": "Friday, May 29, 2026 Dear Shareholders and Investors, We are pleased to advice that Alexander Hansson, Vice-Chairman of NAT has bought 300,000 shares at $5.16 per share, bringing his holdings to 5,855,000 shares. Following this transaction, the Hansson family collectively owns 11,355,000 shares and has 5.4% of the total outstanding shares in NAT. […]",
